	(text "VREF_SAMP: enable input voltage regulation -> CREF = 10 nF\nOT_PROG: stop charging when junction temperature > 65 C\nVBAT_OV: ROV1 = 4.42 MOhm, ROV2 = 5.49 MOhm -> VBAT_OV = 4.26V (should be 4.2V)\nVBAT_UV: RUV1 = 3.83 MOhm, RUV2 = 6.04 MOhm -> VBAT_UV = 3.22V (should be 2.8V)\n\nUsing SM1414KLV panels: V_OC = 2.76 V, V_MPP = 2.23 V\nROC1 = 2.23 V / 2.76 V * 19.8 MOhm = 16 MOhm\nROC2 = 19.8 MOhm - 16 MOhm = 3.8 MOhm -> 3.83 MOhm\nMPP = ROC1 / (ROC1 + ROC2) = 0.81 % - V_MPP / V_OC"
